# Hosted cicada-stable root. One Server line per URL; # starts a comment.
#
# This is the tested Arch snapshot the ISO was built from — kernel, openssl,
# browser runtime and the rest — signed by the Cicada key that ships in
# /etc/pacman.d/cicada-stable-key.gpg. `cicada-update` syncs only this repo;
# raw Arch rolling is not the product update path.
#
# Nothing is fetched until the user runs cicada-update (Settings → Security →
# Check updates). There is no background poll and no automatic upgrade.
https://github.com/kpres12/Cicada.OS/releases/download/channel-latest
